Subject: [PATCH] Read retained disk state by block identity without live UTXO
 traversal

Integration review note (2026-10-15; original source commit had no body):
Exercise retained-body authentication, profile and capacity refusal, historical reads and corruption without changing state or output. Synthetic checkpoint cases do not claim prior complete-block acceptance.

